{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id273555902"}, "name":{"label":"OG1_r"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-16T07:46:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.92.4"}, "id":{"label":"13854439344"}, "title":{"label":"Fun, easy, and useful"}, "content":{"label":"This app has been a lifesaver. I’ve been chronically dehydrated for as long I can can remember. I’m pretty busy and forget to drink throughout the day sometimes not having my first glass of water until mid morning or afternoon. Fast forward, to prevent health issues I needed to start drinking more water and that’s where this app came in. My consumption has increased, my body feels and looks better, I sleep better…honestly, all the benefits of staying hydrated are true and this app gets you there. The one-time fee was also very reasonable. I appreciate the developers making this app available.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=1454778585&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
